  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and transformer aggregation (config_006) achieve the highest RNA-only accuracy (0.653). This experiment tests adding image data (imagenet_vit_l) to this baseline, using concat fusion. It isolates the impact of multimodal integration while keeping RNA and aggregation methods consistent, addressing uncertainty about whether image data improves performance. This balances exploitation of the current RNA-only best and exploration of multimodal potential."  
}

